                    <div class="aalto-user-generated-content"><p>You can find course descriptions in <a href="https://sisu.aalto.fi/student/login">Sisu</a>. In your study plan, choose the course and click the course code or <a href="/en/applications-instructions-and-guidelines/sisus-basic-functions#8-search">search courses by code or name</a>. Learning environments are found in <a href="https://mycourses.aalto.fi/">MyCourses</a> through search or after registration in "My own courses".</p></div>
