<p>In addition, students can include a maximum of 10 credits of practical training (<a href="https://sisu.aalto.fi/student/courseunit/otm-947c8db7-28a4-42e1-934c-032c478305f3/brochure">JOIN.trai</a>) in their elective studies.</p></div>
            
